{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/swap2","title":"std::swap(std::basic_stacktrace)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>swap<small>(std::basic_stacktrace)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/swap2","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Specializes the std::swap algorithm for std::basic_stacktrace. Swaps the contents of lhs and rhs. Equivalent to lhs.swap(rhs);.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/stacktrace\">&lt;stacktrace&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Allocator <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace\"><span class=\"kw3632\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_stacktrace</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace\"><span class=\"kw3632\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_stacktrace</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Specializes